      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "As in the diallelic case, with $n$ alleles the additive effects are defined to be the set of $\\alpha_{i}$ that minimizes $E(\\delta_{ij}^{2})$, obtained from the least-squares solution for the multiple regression",
