      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "This expression is the n-allele extension of Equation 4.5a, with $N_i$ being the number of copies of allele $i$ carried by an individual. For example, for the genotype $G_{34}$, $\\sum \\alpha_i N_i = \\alpha_3 + \\alpha_4$, and $\\delta_{34} = G_{34} - \\mu_G - \\alpha_3 - \\alpha_4$.",
      "source_page": 92,
